    "blocks": [
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "You can apply a bundled source highlighter theme to your source blocks or define and apply your own."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "preamble",
        "id": null,
        "outline": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Rouge bundles several themes you can use to colorize your source blocks. To use one of these themes, first set the value of the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "source-highlighter"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " document attribute to "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "rouge"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". Then, specify the desired theme using the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "rouge-style"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " document attribute."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The following example demonstrates how to apply the monokai theme from Rouge to source blocks."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "= Document Title\n:source-highlighter: rouge\n:rouge-style: monokai"
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "You can generate a list of all available themes by running the following command:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "literal",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "$ ruby -e 'require :rouge.to_s; puts Rouge::Theme.registry.keys.sort.join ?\\n'"
              }
            ],
            "language": null,
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "You can also find the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "list of themes in the Rouge source repository"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://github.com/rouge-ruby/rouge/tree/master/lib/rouge/themes"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "If the bundled themes don’t suit your needs, you can define one of your own."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "using-a-bundled-highlighting-theme",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Using a bundled highlighting theme"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "A custom theme for Rouge is defined using a Ruby class. Start by creating a Ruby source file to define your theme. Name the file according to the name of your theme and put the file in a folder of your choice (e.g., "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "rouge_themes/custom.rb"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": [
                  "path"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "). The name of the Ruby class doesn’t matter, though it’s customary to name it according to the name of the theme as well."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "require 'rouge' unless defined? ::Rouge.version\n\nmodule Rouge; module Themes\n  class Custom < CSSTheme\n    name 'custom'\n\n    style Comment,           fg: '#008800', italic: true\n    style Error,             fg: '#a61717', bg: '#e3d2d2'\n    style Str,               fg: '#0000ff'\n    style Str::Char,         fg: '#800080'\n    style Num,               fg: '#0000ff'\n    style Keyword,           fg: '#000080', bold: true\n    style Operator::Word,    bold: true\n    style Name::Tag,         fg: '#000080', bold: true\n    style Name::Attribute,   fg: '#ff0000'\n    style Generic::Deleted,  fg: '#000000', bg: '#ffdddd', inline_block: true, extend: true\n    style Generic::Inserted, fg: '#000000', bg: '#ddffdd', inline_block: true, extend: true\n    style Text, {}\n  end\nend; end"
              }
            ],
            "language": "ruby",
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "rouge_themes/custom.rb"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Each style declaration accepts the following properties:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "ulist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "fg"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " - sets the foreground (text) color"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "bg"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " - sets the background color"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "bold"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " - change the font weight to bold"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "italic"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " - change the font style to italic"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "underline"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " - add an underline to the text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "inline_block"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " - fill the background color to the height of the line (Asciidoctor PDF only)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "extend"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " - extend the background color to the end of the line for a line-oriented match (Asciidoctor PDF only)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "style": null,
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Colors are defined using hexadecimal format (e.g., #ff0000 for red)."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Use the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Text"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " token to set the background color of the source block and the default text color."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The complete list of tokens can be found in the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "token.rb file"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "metadata": {
                  "rel": "noopener",
                  "window": "_blank"
                },
                "target": "https://github.com/jneen/rouge/blob/master/lib/rouge/token.rb"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " from Rouge. Refer to the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "bundled themes"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "metadata": {
                  "rel": "noopener",
                  "window": "_blank"
                },
                "target": "https://github.com/jneen/rouge/tree/master/lib/rouge/themes"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " to find more examples."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Once you’ve defined your theme, you need to enable it to use it using the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "rouge-style"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " document attribute, which you specify in the document header or via the Asciidoctor CLI or API."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "= Document Title\n:source-highlighter: rouge\n:rouge-style: custom"
              }
            ],
            "language": "asciidoc",
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Finally, you need to activate your theme by requiring the theme file when you invoke Asciidoctor."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "literal",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "$ asciidoctor -r ./rouge_themes/custom.rb sample.adoc"
              }
            ],
            "language": null,
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "You should now see that the source code is highlighted to your liking. For more information about source highlighting with Rouge, refer to the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Rouge project page"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "metadata": {
                  "rel": "noopener",
                  "window": "_blank"
                },
                "target": "https://rouge.jneen.net/"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "define-a-custom-highlighting-theme",
        "level": 1,
